    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vaccine Zombies is a horror survival and save-the-world game. You are in a virus/vaccine nightmare that includes aliens as well as zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Survival:</strong> Navigate a world overrun with terrifying enemies including zombies, aliens, and infected humans. Fight for your life using everything you can find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Conspiracy:</strong> Uncover the origins of the virus, the vaccine, and the extraterrestrial connection. What are they really after?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive World:</strong> From a desolate vaccine zombie colony to an island research facility, explore the ruins of a world on the brink of collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack:</strong> Original music written by award-winning songwriters for this game. It sets the tone and mood for important scenes and leaves you with memorable melodies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Packed Combat:</strong> Engage in intense combat against zombies and alien creatures. Your weapon choices are critical to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Critical Decisions:</strong> Every decision impacts the future. Will you trust those around you, or will you have to go it alone?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vaccine Zombies is a horror survival and save-the-world game. You are in a virus/vaccine nightmare that includes aliens as well as zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Survival:</strong> Navigate a world overrun with terrifying enemies including zombies, aliens, and infected humans. Fight for your life using everything you can find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Conspiracy:</strong> Uncover the origins of the virus, the vaccine, and the extraterrestrial connection. What are they really after?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive World:</strong> From a desolate vaccine zombie colony to an island research facility, explore the ruins of a world on the brink of collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack:</strong> Original music written by award-winning songwriters for this game. It sets the tone and mood for important scenes and leaves you with memorable melodies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Packed Combat:</strong> Engage in intense combat against zombies and alien creatures. Your weapon choices are critical to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Critical Decisions:</strong> Every decision impacts the future. Will you trust those around you, or will you have to go it alone?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You are sent to a Vaccine Zombie colony because you have developed early symptoms of the illness that will soon make you a zombie. You may need to eliminate hundreds of zombies to find the antidote. If successful, your mission will be extended to destroy the aliens that started this.",
